# DRAFT ONLY — not valid for submission until the open items in fdroid/README.md
# are settled. For v1.0.1 this recipe builds from source; F-Droid signs the
# result with its own key (no upstream-binary verification this release).
# Byte-reproducibility of the published v1.0.1 APK was proven experimentally
# (see docs/FDROID_REPRODUCIBILITY_REPORT.md) but only at a developer-machine
# path, so upstream-signature transfer is deferred to v1.0.2.
Categories:
  - Science & Education
